---
/**
 * Footer for the landing page.
 *
 * Deliberately just the name. The technical provenance that used to fill this
 * block — what validates the engine, what it assumes, under what licence it is
 * released — is either on the page above or in the repository, and repeating it
 * at the bottom of every scroll made the page end on a paragraph nobody was
 * going to read.
 *
 * The author credit lives in the #proyecto section, not here: a footer is where
 * a name goes to be overlooked.
 */
---

<!--
  `section-shell` rather than its own container: the footer has to line up with
  the sections above it, and sharing the measure is what guarantees that
  instead of hoping two hard-coded widths stay equal.
-->
<footer class="border-line-strong bg-base border-t">
  <div class="section-shell flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-2 py-7">
    <p class="font-display text-ink text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Pórticos 2D</p>
    <p class="text-ink-faint text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">
      Análisis matricial de pórticos planos
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
